{"ref":"BDB, אֱלִיאֵל","hw":"אֱלִיאֵל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִיאֵל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>Ēl is God</em>, or <em>my God is God</em><strong>)</strong> only Ch.<br><strong>a.</strong>  two or three of David’s chiefs <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:46\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.46\">1 Ch 11:46</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:47\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.47\">47</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.11\">12:11</a>.<br><strong>b.</strong>  chief of Manasseh <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.24\">1 Ch 5:24</a>.<br><strong>c.</strong>  two chiefs of Benjamin <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:20\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.20\">1 Ch 8:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.22\">22</a>.<br><strong>d.</strong>  chief of the Hebronites <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.9\">1 Ch 15:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.11\">11</a>.<br><strong>e.</strong>  a chief Kohathite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.19\">1 Ch 6:19</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִיאָב</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.12\">12</a> cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, אֱלִיהוּ\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_אֱלִיהוּ\">אֱלִיהוּ</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.1\">1 S 1:1</a>.<br><strong>f.</strong>  a Levite <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.13\">2 Ch 31:13</a>.","next":"BDB, אֱלִיאָ֫תָה","prev":"BDB, אֱלִיאָב"}